#
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:10
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_DESTROY\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have defeated the Iron Watch guard. Whatever might have been in their "
"cargo has for certain been destroyed, but you can at least salvage some "
"supplies from the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:13
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_DESTROY\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:18
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_DEADCREW\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have defeated the Iron Watch guard. Without crew on board to stop you, "
"you can investigate their cargo. You find a weapon to bring back to the "
"ship, and move on to scrap their hull."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:22
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_DEADCREW\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:34
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FOLLOWUP\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"By killing the Iron Watch guard, you have no doubt caused them to dispatch "
"reinforcements to track you down. Watch your step as you explore the sector."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:43
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FOLLOWUP\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:47
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FOLLOWUP\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:55
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:56
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/beaconType/visitedTooltip"
msgstr "Explored location. Nothing left of interest."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:57
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/beaconType/undiscoveredTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:59
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"An Iron Watch ship moves in to attack! Based on the vengeful look in their "
"captain's eye, this is no doubt the ship dispatched by the guard to hunt you"
" down!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:63
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:71
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_LIGHT_REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:72
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_LIGHT_REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/beaconType/visitedTooltip"
msgstr "Explored location. Nothing left of interest."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:73
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_LIGHT_REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/beaconType/undiscoveredTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:75
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_LIGHT_REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"An Iron Watch ship moves in to attack! Based on the vengeful look in their "
"captain's eye, this is no doubt the ship dispatched by the guard to hunt you"
" down!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:81
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_LIGHT_REINFORCEMENTS_OG_IRON\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:87
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_START_OG_IRON\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch are a collective of explorers, scientists, and pirates who "
"ventured out into unexplored space. This is one of their rare settlements, "
"now no longer so out of the way as it once was."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:88
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_START_OG_IRON\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"This somewhat isolated region was thrown into chaos at the start of the "
"Rebellion. One of the rare homes of the Iron Watch, it's become far more "
"populated in recent times."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:101
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"START_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_og_iron\""
" and @lvl=\"3\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:105
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"START_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_og_iron\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:109
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"START_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_og_iron\""
" and @lvl=\"-999\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:114
msgid "data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You are immediately 'greeted' by the guard. \"Greetings friends! Welcome to "
"our sector. I'm sure you're aware that there is a fee for entry...\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:116
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "We refuse to pay the fee, fight your way through!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:118
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You mute the ship and prepare for combat."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:121
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:127
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Pay the fee."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:129
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The guard nods and combs over the scrap for a brief moment. \"Very well. "
"Security will let you through momentarily.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:136
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Request a waver because of your mission."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:140
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr "(Iron Watch Crew) Request free passage."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:142
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Very well. Good luck with your mission.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:146
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"mind\"]/text"
msgstr "(Mind Control) Convince the guard to leave you alone."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:150
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"BLUELIST_WEAPONS_MIND_CONTROL\"]/text"
msgstr "(Mind Control Weapon) Convince the guard to leave you alone."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:154
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"BLUELIST_WEAPONS_MIND_AFFECT\"]/text"
msgstr "(Mind Affecting Weapon) Induce chaos within the guard and slip past."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:158
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"cloaking\"]/text"
msgstr "(Cloaking) Cloak and try to escape."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:162
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"engines\"]/text"
msgstr "(Adv. Engines) Try to escape the guard."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:166
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"pilot\"]/text"
msgstr "(Adv. Piloting) Activate the auto-pilot to try and escape."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:172
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_WAVER_FAIL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Why should I wave your fee? You are a Renegade, correct? If you are not "
"aware, the Iron Watch is not beholden to Federation laws, and frankly having"
" people like you here is a liability. We should be charging you more, not "
"less.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:174
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_WAVER_FAIL\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Then we'll fight our way through!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:176
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_WAVER_FAIL\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You mute the ship and prepare for combat."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:179
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_WAVER_FAIL\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:185
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_WAVER_FAIL\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Pay the fee."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:187
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_WAVER_FAIL\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The guard nods and combs over the scrap for a brief moment. \"Very well. "
"Security will let you through momentarily.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:196
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_WAVER\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"The guard scratches their face. \"As you are likely aware, the Iron Watch is"
" not beholden to Federation laws or jurisdiction. That said, I understand "
"that your cause represents the best interests of everyone here. The "
"Federation might not be our friend, but the Rebellion isn't either. I will "
"do you this one favour, but do not expect everyone to be so generous.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:200
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_CRIMINAL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Something seems off here. Usually, the Iron Watch wouldn't mind a ship like "
"yours too much, but now, you catch suspicious chatter on the guard ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:202
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_CRIMINAL\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:204
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_CRIMINAL\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"It seems your track record has caught up to you. The guard's crew have heard"
" enough of the crimes you've been committing, and they don't intend to let "
"you into the sector!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:207
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_CRIMINAL\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:215
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FRIENDLY\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Good word has spread around, the guard immediately waves the usual entry fee"
" and you're allowed in freely."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:218
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Ignore the guard."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:220
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You now have some time to do something on the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:222
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:226
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:232
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Contact the guard."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:236
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Attack the guard."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:241
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:249
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_GUARD_OG_IRON_CONTACT\"]/text[1]"
msgstr "\"We acknowledge your hail. What is it that you seek friend?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:250
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_GUARD_OG_IRON_CONTACT\"]/text[2]"
msgstr "The Iron Watch captain accepts your hail, but does not speak a word."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:251
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_GUARD_OG_IRON_CONTACT\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"A brief message is sent back to your ship in response. \"We have received "
"your request for communications. What is it you need friend?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:256
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Request supplies."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:260
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Demand supplies."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:264
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[@req=\"weapons\"]/text"
msgstr "(Upg. Weapons) Threaten the guard."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:268
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr "(Iron Watch Crew) Request assistance."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:270
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/event/text"
msgstr "\"And a fellow citizen of the Iron Watch? Take this gift of goodwill!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:275
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[5]/text"
msgstr "Change your mind and leave the guard alone."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:277
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[5]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You apologise and end comms. The guard makes no attempts to communicate "
"further."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:279
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[5]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:283
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_INTERACT\"]/choice[5]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:291
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_REQUEST\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"I'm afraid we don't have much to spare, good luck on your mission "
"friend.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:294
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_REQUEST\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr "\"Of course we can help, take this as a gift of goodwill.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:299
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_DEMAND\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"That's no way to speak to an ally. I wish you luck on your mission but I "
"suggest you stop trying to contact me.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:303
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_THREATEN\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"The guard makes no attempt to respond to your threats, at least not "
"verbally. Instead, they power up their weapons and move in to attack!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:306
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_THREATEN\"]/event[1]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:311
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_THREATEN\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"There is no need for violence, friend. We will give you some supplies as "
"you request, so long as you power down those weapons.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:314
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"GUARD_OG_IRON_THREATEN\"]/event[2]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:322
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_UPDATE_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION INCREASED - IRON WATCH]\n"
"\tYou have done a good deed here in the eyes of the Iron Watch. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see positive support from the Iron Watch and its allies."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:327
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_UPDATE_OG_IRON_COMBAT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION INCREASED - IRON WATCH]\n"
"\tYou have done a good deed here in the eyes of the Iron Watch. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see positive support from the Iron Watch and its allies."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:331
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_UPDATE_OG_IRON_COMBAT\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:336
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_UPDATE_DOUBLE_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION INCREASED X2 - IRON WATCH]\n"
"\tYou have done a good deed here in the eyes of the Iron Watch. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see positive support from the Iron Watch and its allies."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:341
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_DECREASE_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION DECREASED - IRON WATCH]\n"
"\tYour actions here, justifiable or not, will not reflect well in the eyes of the Iron Watch or its citizens. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see negative reactions from the Iron Watch and its allies."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:346
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_DECREASE_DOUBLE_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION DECREASED X2 - IRON WATCH]\n"
"\tYour actions here, justifiable or not, will not reflect well in the eyes of the Iron Watch or its citizens. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see negative reactions from the Iron Watch and its allies.\n"
"\tFor your extra egregious actions, your reputation was decreased twice."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:352
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_DECREASE_OG_IRON_COMBAT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION DECREASED - IRON WATCH]\n"
"\tYour actions here, justifiable or not, will not reflect well in the eyes of the Iron Watch or its citizens. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see negative reactions from the Iron Watch and its allies."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:356
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_DECREASE_OG_IRON_COMBAT\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:361
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_DECREASE_DOUBLE_OG_IRON_COMBAT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"[REPUTATION DECREASED X2 - IRON WATCH]\n"
"\tYour actions here, justifiable or not, will not reflect well in the eyes of the Iron Watch or its citizens. Continuously perform actions like this and you might start to see negative reactions from the Iron Watch and its allies.\n"
"\tFor your extra egregious actions, your reputation was decreased twice."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:366
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"REPUTATION_DECREASE_DOUBLE_OG_IRON_COMBAT\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:380
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You've arrived at the Long-Range Beacon. When the FTL Drive is charged you can jump to the next Sector.\n"
"An Iron Watch station protects the beacon from any ne'er-do-wells as well as monitoring traffic out of the Sector."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:384
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_POSITIVE\"]/text"
msgstr "(>1 Reputation) The station is attempting to hail you."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:388
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OG_IRON\"]/choice[@req=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_NEGATIVE\"]/text"
msgstr "(<2 Reputation) The station ignores you."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:392
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OG_IRON\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Explore."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:396
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OG_IRON\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:400
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"FINISH_BEACON_OG_IRON\"]/choice[5]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:406
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_STATION\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Captain. Word of your actions in Iron Watch space has travelled fast, the higher-ups are impressed.\n"
"We're aware of your standing agreement with the Federation regarding the rebellion, and we have no intention of pulling you from your mission.\n"
"What we do have, however, is a proposition, one we believe serves your interests as much as our own.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:411
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_STATION\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:413
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_STATION\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Our Intelligence forces have uncovered that the New Dawn are coordinating "
"with the Rebel fleet. Their target is a secret Iron Watch stronghold deep in"
" unexplored space, we believe their fleet is already on the way there.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:415
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_STATION\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:417
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_STATION\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"With an attack imminent, Admiral Micari of the Iron Watch Defence fleet has personally requested your assistance. Together, we have an opportunity to strike a decisive blow against both of our enemies in a single battle.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tYou've been cleared for access to the sector coordinates. If you choose to make your way there, seek out Admiral Micari upon arrival at the entry beacon. Good Luck, Captain.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:422
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_STATION\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Explore."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:426
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_STATION\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:430
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FINISH_STATION\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:446
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OG_IRON\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch captain lets out one final expletive as the ship is "
"obliterated."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:447
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OG_IRON\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"The hull of the Iron Watch vessel is dispersed out into space. You swoop in "
"to salvage the remains."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:448
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OG_IRON\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch ship explodes, extinguishing all lives within. Your crew "
"avoids their remains as they salvage the ship pieces."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:449
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OG_IRON\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"One of the turrets is launched off into empty space as the ship explodes, "
"throwing valuable debris in every direction."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:457
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"\"Your bloodlust... will be your downfall someday, Renegade. You are only "
"proof... the Federation... is no better than the Rebellion...\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:458
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"Without a word, the Iron Watch captain falls to the ground, gasping for air "
"as the life is extinguished from their eyes. You salvage the hull of their "
"ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:459
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"\"You will regret this! Karma always comes back to people like you. Damn you"
" Renegades... the Iron Watch would have been better off with the "
"Rebellion...\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:465
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Accept their surrender."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:474
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"\"Alright, you win! Here's some equipment from our stores. Leave us alone!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:475
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[2]"
msgstr "The ship repeatedly hails you. It looks like they want to surrender."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:476
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"\"You are considerably more well-armed than I would have thought. We "
"surrender.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:477
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"They send you a message: \"Your ship is surprisingly well equipped! Please "
"take this and let us live.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:478
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[5]"
msgstr "\"Please don't kill us. We will give you everything we have!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:479
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[6]"
msgstr "They offer you some of their cargo if you let them live."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:480
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[7]"
msgstr ""
"They offer to give you some of their goods if you don't destroy their ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:481
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[8]"
msgstr ""
"You get a frantic message, \"Take everything we have. Just don't kill us!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:482
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[9]"
msgstr "\"You have clearly bested us. We merely request our lives.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:483
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[10]"
msgstr ""
"\"You have made your point, we are beaten. Take these and leave us to our "
"shame.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:484
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OG_IRON\"]/text[11]"
msgstr "\"Take everything we have and let's both forget this happened.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:488
msgid "data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"ESCAPE_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Scans show that the Iron Watch ship is trying to escape. Destroy it before "
"it can get away!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:501
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_GOTAWAY_OG_IRON\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch vessel has slipped from your grasp, abandoning you at the "
"beacon."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:502
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_GOTAWAY_OG_IRON\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"Your attempts at destroying the Iron Watch vessel have failed, and the ship "
"has escaped."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:505
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"GOTAWAY_OG_IRON_REMAINS\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch vessel may have escaped, but not everything has gone wrong. A"
" trail of scrap from the wreckage has been left behind, which you collect."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:567
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/text"
msgstr "A large market surrounds this iron watch station."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:570
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Purchase a discounted turret."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:572
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You load up the turret before moving onto the rest of the market."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:578
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Shop."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:584
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[@req=\"mind\"]/text"
msgstr "(Mind Control) \"Negotiate\" an even lower price."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:586
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[@req=\"mind\"]/event/text"
msgstr "You load up the turret before moving onto the rest of the market."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:592
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[@req=\"mind\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Shop."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:598
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr "(Iron Watch Crew) Negotiate an even lower price."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:600
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/event/text"
msgstr "You load up the turret before moving onto the rest of the market."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:606
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Shop."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:612
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "Attack the station!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:614
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[4]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"It's highly unlikely the market will want to trade with you after this, but "
"that won't stop you from harassing random civilians."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:617
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[4]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:623
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"STOREEVENT_OG_IRON_TURRETS_STATION\"]/choice[5]/text"
msgstr "Just shop around."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:643
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon to discover an Iron Watch ship. The captain is seemingly quite distressed as you can hear yelling over the public channels.\n"
"\t\"What do you mean it's not a turret?\" You can hear the faint noise of one of their crew trying to explain something the captain clearly doesn't understand.\n"
"\t\"So we were SCAMMED? That conniving merchant, ohhh if I see him again he's dead!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:647
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Continue Listening."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:649
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Eventually the captain's anger reaches a crescendo and orders the would-be "
"turret thrown out the airlock. \"I want it out of sight, get us OUT OF "
"HERE!\" With that the Iron Watch ship jumps away. Now that you're on your "
"own, you have time to scoop up the \"turret\" and examine it yourself, it "
"turns out it was just a simple defence drone."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:653
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:657
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:663
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Avoid getting in the way of the angry captain."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:665
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You hide on the far side of a moon and hope the Iron Watch ship doesn't pick"
" you up."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:667
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:671
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DEFENCE_DRONE\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:681
msgid "data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"An Iron Watch vessel is advertising a temporary position to help in an "
"experiment. They require an escort into the nearby asteroid field to test a "
"modification to their turret."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:683
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Agree to help."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:686
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You move in behind the Iron Watch ship and head into the asteroid field. "
"\"We're just calibrating the turret, it shouldn't take more than half a "
"minute.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:690
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//triggeredEvent[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE_TURRET\"]/triggeredEventBox/tooltip"
msgstr "Time until the Iron Watch's turret is calibrated."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:698
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Ignore the request."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:700
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You avoid the Iron Watch ship and prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:702
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:706
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:714
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE_ION_BLAST\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Come in, Come in, something has gone terribly wrong, our turrets have shut"
" down.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:716
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE_ION_BLAST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_POWER\"]/text"
msgstr "(Bonus Power Crew) Send your crewman to overcharge their systems."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:720
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE_ION_BLAST\"]/choice[@req=\"battery\"]/text"
msgstr "(Backup Battery) Use your extra power to overcharge their systems."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:724
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE_ION_BLAST\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "There's nothing you can do..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:738
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE_PASS_ION\"]/text"
msgstr "You manage to restore power to their turrets."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:742
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE_PASS\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"We're finished, thanks for the help captain.\" The ship sends over some "
"supplies in payment for your escort."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:748
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_FOR_SCIENCE_BLAST\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You watch helplessly as a large asteroid rips through the Iron Watch ship. "
"It fragments into a cloud of debris which quickly diffuse into the asteroid "
"field, you're able to collect some of the wreckage before you leave."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:767
msgid "data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_WRECK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You've come across the wreck of a strange ship. It appears to be one the New"
" Dawn ships you've heard of around here, a splinter group of the iron watch "
"who appear to have allied with the rebellion."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:769
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_WRECK\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Investigate."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:771
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_WRECK\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The ship appears stripped bare, all but a few sections have anything "
"salvageable. You collect whatever you can before returning to your own ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:776
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_WRECK\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Ignore the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:778
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_WRECK\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You avoid the ship and prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:780
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_WRECK\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:784
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_WRECK\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:807
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_RESCUE\"]/destroyed/text"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch ship breaks apart. You hasten to contact the civilian ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:810
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_RESCUE\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Contact the civilian ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:815
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_RESCUE\"]/deadCrew/text"
msgstr ""
"No more life signs detected on the Iron Watch ship. You hasten to contact "
"the civilian ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:818
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_RESCUE\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Contact the civilian ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:826
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon to discover an Iron Watch ship in pursuit of a "
"civilian, it appears the rules must be especially relaxed in this part of "
"Iron Watch space for their own ships to be turning to piracy."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:828
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Aid the civilian ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:830
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You power on your weapons and move in to attack."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:833
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:839
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Stay out of it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:842
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The fight brings them out of your immediate scanning range. After a time the"
" distress calls stop."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:844
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:848
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:858
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon to discover an Iron Watch ship in pursuit of a "
"civilian, it appears the Iron Watch is taking advantage of the pulsar here "
"to take advantage of civilians, although illegal in most areas of iron watch"
" space it appears this ship isn't worried about being caught."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:860
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Aid the civilian ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:862
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You power on your weapons and move in to attack."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:865
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:871
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Stay out of it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:874
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The fight brings them out of your immediate scanning range. After a time the"
" distress calls stop."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:876
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:880
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_CIVILIAN_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:890
msgid "data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You've arrived at the beacon to discover one of those strange New Dawn ships"
" attacking a civilian, it doesn't appear that they've noticed you yet."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:892
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Aid the civilian ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:894
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The civilian ship explodes before you're able to do anything, the New Dawn "
"vessel notices you and turns to run, within a moment they've jumped away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:897
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Loot the remains of the civilian vessel."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:899
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You move in and begin looting the civilian when an Iron Watch ship arrives "
"at the beacon. They appear to think you're responsible for the wreck as they"
" immediately move in to attack."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:903
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:909
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Report the attack via a nearby Iron Watch outpost."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:911
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You contact the local Iron Watch authorities and let them know about the "
"attack, a short while later an Iron Watch ship arrives. \"I'm sorry you had "
"to see that captain, these attacks are getting worse and worse every day. I "
"have these supplies here to be given to those attacked, but it doesn't look "
"they'll be needing them, why don't you take them instead.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:915
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:923
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Stay out of it."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:926
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The fight brings them out of your immediate scanning range. After a time the"
" distress calls stop."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:928
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_SETUP\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
