msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/surrender/text"
msgstr "Please, you can have the wreck, just let us live!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:943
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/surrender/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Accept their offer."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:947
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/surrender/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Surrender is not an option."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:955
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:963
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:970
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_SECURE_SURRENDER\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You scrap the wreck and collect what you can from it's stores before "
"preparing for your next jump"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:973
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_SECURE_SURRENDER\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:978
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_SECURE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You scrap the wreck and collect what you can from it's stores before "
"preparing for your next jump"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:983
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You're greeted by an Iron Watch ship, \"Hello Captain, I don't suppose "
"you've seen a ship wreck out here somewhere. Apparently a New Dawn transport"
" was seen heading into this asteroid field after being hit by a nearby anti-"
"ship battery. We believe they may have been wrecked around here somewhere.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:985
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Help them search for the transport."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:989
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/choice[@req=\"sensors\""
" and @lvl=\"2\"]/text"
msgstr "(Upg. Sensors) Perform a scan of the area."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:993
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/choice[@req=\"sensors\""
" and @lvl=\"3\"]/text"
msgstr "(Adv. Sensors) Perform a deep scan of the asteroid field."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:997
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "Politely decline."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:999
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/choice[4]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch ship eventually disappears from view as it searches the "
"asteroid field."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1001
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/choice[4]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1005
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT\"]/choice[4]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1014
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You eventually pickup the odd transport, it appears to be punctured by "
"several asteroids. You begin searching the vessel and find a pristine weapon"
" onboard, a few moments later the Iron Watch vessel appears, \"Oh good you "
"found it, thanks for the help guys, we'll take it from here.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1017
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Attack the ship to claim the wreck for yourself."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1019
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"As you power on your weapons the Iron Watch vessel seems to notice what your"
" doing, their captain sputters out a few expletives but turns on her own "
"weapons in response."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1022
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1028
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Leave them to the wreck."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1030
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "The wreck eventually drifts out of view."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1032
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1036
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1044
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND_LATE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Eventually you find the wreck, and as it happens the Iron Watch vessel. It "
"appears they've already been scrapping the wreck for some time. \"Oh good "
"you're still alive, we appreciate the help but we don't need anything else, "
"good luck with your mission.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1046
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND_LATE\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Attack the ship to claim the wreck for yourself."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1048
