#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1065
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_FIND_LATE\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1072
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_EXPLORE_TRANSPORT_SEARCH\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"You search the asteroid field for what feels like hours, but can't find "
"anything. You did stumble across what appears to be a cargo container with "
"some basic supplies in it however."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1095
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_WATCH_PIRATE\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1104
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_WATCH_PIRATE\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1113
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon to find a heavily damage Iron Watch ship locked in "
"battle with a pirate, without help the Iron Watch ship won't last very long."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1115
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Aid the Iron Watch ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1117
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You power on your weapons, the pirate vessel, sensing the greater threat, "
"turns it's attention to you."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1120
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1126
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Avoid getting involved."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1128
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The fight brings them out of your immediate scanning range. After a time the"
" distress calls stop."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1130
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1134
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1149
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH_PIRATE_DEAD\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch has partially recovered from the fight earlier, they thank "
"you for rescuing them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1151
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH_PIRATE_DEAD\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Capitalise on the damage and attack them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1153
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH_PIRATE_DEAD\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The crew of the Iron Watch look in horror as you power up your weapons and "
"prepare to attack them."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1156
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH_PIRATE_DEAD\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1162
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH_PIRATE_DEAD\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/text"
msgstr "(Iron Watch Crew) Request supplies."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1164
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH_PIRATE_DEAD\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_OG_IRON\"]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Of course, take these as thanks.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1169
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_WATCH_PIRATE_DEAD\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1178
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The civilian vessel here appears stranded by the pulsar. \"Captain, thank "
"goodness you're here, our jump drives were taken out when the pulsar hit as "
"just as we were executing a jump, the power spike fried the engines. We're "
"low on supplies and don't have a dedicated engineer onboard, any help would "
"be appreciated.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1180
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Send some supplies over."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1182
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thanks for the help, hopefully we'll be able to get this fixed quickly.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1188
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1194
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_ENGINEER\"]/text"
msgstr "(Engineer Crew) See if your engineer can help."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1196
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_ENGINEER\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your crew take some time experimenting and working with the faulty jump "
"drive. Eventually, they're able to get to the root of the problem, much to "
"the Captains's delight. \"All systems are nominal... Great! It should come "
"back on once we jump. Thanks for the help.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1199
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_ENGINEER\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1205
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[@req=\"DRONE_CONTROL_REPAIR_CREW\"]/text"
msgstr "(Repair Drone) Send a Repair Drone. [-1|]"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1209
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\"]/text"
msgstr "Attempt to fix their problem."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1213
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[5]/text"
msgstr "Attack while they are helpless!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1215
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[5]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You need all the scrap you can get, and this ship will be an easy target."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1218
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[5]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1224
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[6]/text"
msgstr "Apologise and say you can't help."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1226
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[6]/event/text"
msgstr "The Captain of the ship sighs. \"Send someone our way if you can.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1228
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[6]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1232
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR\"]/choice[6]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1241
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_REPAIR\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your drone begins to tinker with the broken jump drive. Before too long, the"
" drone identifies the problem and the drive comes to life. \"All systems are"
" nominal... Great! Thanks for the help.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1247
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_REPAIR\"]/event[1]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1252
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_REPAIR\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your drone begins to tinker with the broken jump drive. It returns a report "
"saying that there is insufficient resources to repair, but prints a readout "
"of how it could be repaired. \"Well, I guess it's better than nothing... Now"
" we know what we need.\" They give you a small reward."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1259
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_REPAIR\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your drone begins to tinker with the broken jump drive. It momentarily comes"
" to life, then pops. The drone prints a readout of the problems that it "
"identified but couldn't fix. \"Well, I guess it's better than nothing... "
"Maybe we can make do with this for now.\" They give you a modest reward."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1268
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_CREW\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your crew take some time experimenting and working with the faulty jump "
"drive. Eventually, they're able to get to the root of the problem, much to "
"the Captains's delight. \"All systems are nominal... Great! It should come "
"back on once we jump. Thanks for the help.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1271
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_CREW\"]/event[1]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1276
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_CREW\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your crew take some time experimenting and working with the faulty jump "
"drive. While they don't get it working, they manage to diagnose it. \"Well, "
"I guess it's better than nothing... Now we know what's wrong.\" They give "
"you a small reward."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1280
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_CREW\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your crew take some time experimenting and working with the faulty jump "
"drive. It momentarily comes to life, then pops. Seems like they only got it "
"partially working. \"Well, I guess it's better than nothing... Maybe we can "
"make do with this for now.\" They give you a modest reward."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1284
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_CREW\"]/event[4]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your crew take some time experimenting and working with the faulty jump "
"drive. As one of your crew adjusts something, the drive pops and burns "
"before catching fire. Seems like you completely broke it. \"Way to go, "
"jackass. Now we're completely screwed.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1287
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DISTRESS_PULSAR_SEND_CREW\"]/event[5]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your crew take some time experimenting and working with the faulty jump "
"drive. Try as they might, they have absolutely no idea what's wrong with it."
" The Crew shake their heads. \"How did you think you would know what was "
"wrong if we couldn't figure it out...?\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1305
msgid "data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You've arrived face to face with an Iron Watch transport, your sensors are "
"able to detect their jump drive being charged."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1307
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1309
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"As they execute the jump, you watch an undefended asteroid slam into the "
"side of the ship, tearing a section free. This doesn't impede the jump and "
"the transport disappears a moment later."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1312
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Investigate."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1314
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Most of the wreckage is useless, but you do eventually find a cargo "
"container, and inside an unusual looking turret. It appears that this turret"
" had a specific destination, an outpost nearby. You note down the "
"coordinates."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1318
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1322
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1334
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr "The intended destination of the turret you found."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1338
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"This beacon is home to a large outpost, several ships can be seen in and "
"around the outpost. You spot the damaged transport nearby."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1340
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr "Dock near the damaged transport."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1342
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You exit your ship and immediately overhear the loud conversation happening "
"nearby \"I don't know what we're going to do, they're going to take away my "
"ship over this. Why did we ever go into that asteroid field, it didn't even "
"save us more than like 1 jump.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1344
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice[@req=\"OG_TURRET_LASER_MINI_DAWN_2\" and "
"not(@lvl)]/text"
msgstr "Show them the missing turret."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1346
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice[@req=\"OG_TURRET_LASER_MINI_DAWN_2\" and "
"not(@lvl)]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Oh thank goodness, how in the multiverse did you find it?\" You explain "
"that you saw them get hit and lose it. \"You're a lifesaver, here take these"
" supplies as a reward.\" With the turret in tow, the captain of the "
"transport heads off into the outpost."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1351
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice[@req=\"OG_TURRET_LASER_MINI_DAWN_2\" and "
"not(@lvl)]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1357
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice[@req=\"OG_TURRET_LASER_MINI_DAWN_2\" and "
"@lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "You don't have the missing turret with you."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1361
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Quietly leave."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1363
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr "You prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1365
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1369
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1377
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CHECK_ANY_CREW\""
" and @lvl=\"-999\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You can dock at the outpost but without crew it will be hard to do anything "
"there."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1381
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Ignore the outpost."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1383
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr "You prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1385
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1389
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DELIVERY_OUTPOST\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1408
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon face to face with a New Dawn scout. You immediately"
" detect the ship powering up it's jump drive, you only have a moment before "
"they jump away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1410
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Attempt to fire on their jump drive!"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1414
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_og_dawn\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr "\"Hold on!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1416
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_og_dawn\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The ship doesn't immediately jump away, it appears you have their attention. You explain that you're not going to kill them, you just want to know what they're doing here.\n"
"They don't immediately respond and they keep their jump drive ready."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1419
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_og_dawn\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1421
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_og_dawn\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Eventually they respond, \"Renegade, if you want to know anything you're "
"going to have to prove yourself to us. There's a nearby Iron Watch supply "
"depot, go there and take it out, then we'll talk.\" With that they jump "
"away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1429
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_og_dawn\""
" and @lvl=\"-999\"]/text"
msgstr "\"Hold on!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1431
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_og_dawn\""
" and @lvl=\"-999\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The ship immediately shuts off their comms, a moment later they're gone. It "
"appears that they have no interest in hearing you out, perhaps if they had "
"heard of you they'd be more willing to listen."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1434
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_og_dawn\""
" and @lvl=\"-999\"]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1438
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_og_dawn\""
" and @lvl=\"-999\"]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1444
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "Let them leave."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1446
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[4]/event/text"
msgstr "The ship jumps away, you prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1449
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[4]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1453
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT\"]/choice[4]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1461
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_FIRE\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"The New Dawn scout easily dodges your attack, a moment later they've jumped "
"away."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1464
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_FIRE\"]/event[1]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1469
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_FIRE\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr "You score a direct hit on their engines, disabling their jump drive."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1473
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//eventList[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_FIRE\"]/event[2]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1484
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_DAWN_QUEST\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1492
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_DAWN_QUEST\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1500
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr ""
"Location of the Iron Watch supply depot you've been tasked with destroying "
"by the New Dawn."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1505
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You've arrived at beacon to find the Iron Watch supply depot, unfortunately "
"it's not alone, an Iron Watch ship stands on guard nearby."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1507
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Attack the guard."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1509
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch vessel quickly moves in between you and the depot, prepare to"
" fight."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1512
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1518
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Warn them about the attack."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1520
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch are very grateful for the warning and they offer some "
"supplies as thanks."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1523
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1529
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Abandon your mission."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1531
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr "You keep your distance and prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1534
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1538
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST\"]/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1548
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST_WIN\"]/loadEventList/event/text"
msgstr ""
"With the guard ship dealt with you're able to access, loot and destroy the "
"depot. It appears that the New Dawn were watching because it isn't very long"
" before you receive a message. \"It appears you've already met with some "
"other members of the New Dawn, We'll find you at the New Dawn forward "
"operating base.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1551
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST_WIN\"]/loadEventList/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1558
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST_WIN_INITIATE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"With the guard ship dealt with you're able to access, loot and destroy the "
"depot. It appears that the New Dawn were watching because it isn't very long"
" before you receive a message. \"Find us at the New Dawn forward operating "
"base, we'll talk there.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1562
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_DAWN_HIDEOUT_QUEST_WIN_INITIATE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1591
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OG_IRON_SHIP\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1596
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_ENCOUNTER_OG_IRON\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"As you jump into the system a rogue Iron Watch ship advances on your "
"position. They are refusing all hails. Prepare for a fight."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1597
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_ENCOUNTER_OG_IRON\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"Soon after arriving in the system you are hailed by a small cruiser. \"What "
"good fortune that we happen to run into each other. Nothing personal, but "
"you have some information we need!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1598
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_ENCOUNTER_OG_IRON\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"The only other ship at this beacon messages you: \"Finally, after months of "
"waiting, someone has fallen into our trap!\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1599
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_ENCOUNTER_OG_IRON\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"You barely have time to register jump completion before your ship warns you "
"of an incoming ship with weapons hot."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1603
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OG_IRON_PULSAR\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"This beacon has been placed too close to a neutron star! The radiation field"
" will temporarily ionise your systems. Iron Watch ships have apparently been"
" designed to remain quite effective in the presence of pulsars, you're in "
"for a bad time."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1607
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OG_IRON_PULSAR\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1613
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OG_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"This beacon has been placed too close to a neutron star! The radiation field"
" will temporarily ionise your systems. A pirate, apparently oblivious to the"
" danger of the pulsar, moves in to engage."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1617
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"ENCOUNTER_OG_PIRATE_PULSAR\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1629
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1637
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1645
msgid "data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You've arrived at a rather desolate beacon, there is very little of note "
"here apart from the Iron Watch outpost you detect in orbit around a nearby "
"planet."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1647
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1649
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Just as you were getting bored another ship jumps into the system, its "
"unlike any Iron Watch ship you've seen before, it appears to be some type of"
" new cruiser, possibly a prototype."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1652
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1654
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You watch as the prototype docks with the distant outpost. It's only a few "
"minutes later when the ship undocks and jumps away before you can do "
"anything."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1657
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_og_iron\""
" and @lvl=\"2\"]/text"
msgstr "(Positive Reputation) Inquire about the ship with the outpost."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1661
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_og_iron\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "(Neutral Reputation) Inquire about the ship with the outpost."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1665
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_og_iron\""
" and @lvl=\"-999\"]/text"
msgstr "(Negative Reputation) Inquire about the ship with the outpost."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1669
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"sensors\"]/text"
msgstr "(Adv. Sensors) Scan the jump wake created by the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1671
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[@req=\"sensors\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"By scanning the radiation emitted by the jump you're able to triangulate the"
" approximate destination for the prototype."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1676
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[5]/text"
msgstr "Move on."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1678
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[5]/event/text"
msgstr "You keep your distance and prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1680
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[5]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1684
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice[5]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1696
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST_FRIENDLY\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"It's a moment before the the outpost greets you, \"We're not really supposed"
" to give out this information, but we'll make an exception for you.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1699
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1703
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST_FRIENDLY\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1708
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"It's a moment before the the outpost greets you, and when they do you're met"
" with an immediate wall, \"I'm sorry, we can't provide any information on "
"that ship.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1710
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Would this change your mind?"

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1715
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The outpost receives your scrap, \"While your donation is very kind, we "
"still can't tell you anything about that ship.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1717
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Offer a larger bribe."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1722
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The outpost receives your scrap, \"Now that's something, we can't tell you, "
"but recently our communications have actually been malfunctioning and "
"sending secure information on public channels, it really needs to be looked "
"into...\" A moment later your crew pickups the location of a ship being "
"broadcast on one of the public channels."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1727
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Threaten the outpost for the information."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1729
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The outpost is effectively defenceless against your weapons, they quickly "
"capitulate to your demands, uploading the data on the prototype. They also "
"kindly return your donation."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1735
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1741
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Move on without the information."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1743
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr "You move away from the outpost and prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1745
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
