msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Threaten the outpost for the information."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1769
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The outpost is effectively defenceless against your weapons, they quickly "
"capitulate to your demands, uploading the data on the prototype."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1772
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1778
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"hacking\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr "(Hacking) Remotely access their data storage."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1780
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"hacking\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"While you make small talk with the outpost, you configure the Hacking system"
" to get a read of their data storage, and download their recent "
"communications data. Once the download is complete, you bid farewell with "
"the location of the prototype in hand. Unfortunately your hack is detected "
"just as you're leaving."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1783
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST\"]/choice[@req=\"hacking\""
