"It's a moment before the the outpost greets you, and when they do you're met"
" with an immediate wall, \"Even if we could tell you we wouldn't.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1814
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST_CRIMINAL\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Threaten the outpost for the information."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1816
