"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST_CRIMINAL\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The outpost is effectively defenceless against your weapons, they quickly "
