"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST_CRIMINAL\"]/choice[@req=\"hacking\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr "(Hacking) Remotely access their data storage."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1827
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST_CRIMINAL\"]/choice[@req=\"hacking\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You configure the Hacking system to get a read of their data storage, and "
"download their recent communications data. Once the download is complete, "
"you bid farewell with the location of the prototype in hand. Unfortunately "
"your hack is detected just as you're leaving and you detect them reporting "
"it to nearby Iron Watch outposts."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1830
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_OUTPOST_CRIMINAL\"]/choice[@req=\"hacking\""
