#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1864
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_QUEST\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1873
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_QUEST\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1881
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr "Location of the prototype Iron Watch vessel."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1886
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the beacon to discover the Iron Watch vessel in orbit around "
"the pulsar here, it appears they're testing their weapon systems on a nearby"
" asteroid."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1888
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1890
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"As you watch a large wave from the pulsar sweeps across the prototype, your sensors indicate several of the systems onboard are immediately disabled by the pulsar.\n"
"If that's not bad enough a new ship reveals itself from behind a nearby asteroid, It appears to be one of those New Dawn ships, and it's moving in on the prototype."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1894
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Move in and defend the Iron Watch prototype."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1898
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Aid the New Dawn ship in it's attack on the heavily armed prototype."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1901
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You turn you attention to the prototype, unfortunately by the time you're "
"ready the ship has almost fully recovered from the pulsar hit. You're not "
"alone though, you have the support of the New Dawn ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1905
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1911
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Retreat to a safe distance and stay out of the fight."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1913
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr "You move away from the two ships and prepare for your next jump."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1916
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1920
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DESTINATION\"]/choice/event/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1930
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_WIN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Iron Watch ship has mostly recovered from the attack, they contact you. "
"\"We're grateful for your help Captain, we're not sure we would have "
"survived that without it. Perhaps it's time we took a more active presence "
"in your war with the rebellion. We'll send the blueprints for the prototype "
"along to the federation, perhaps they'll be able to use it.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1933
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_WIN\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1941
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DAWN_WIN\"]/loadEventList/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The New Dawn ship is still wary of you even after the fight. You watch as "
"they move up to the wreck and carefully extract a single component, you're "
"not what it is, but with that done they back away from the wreck, "
"uninterested in the rest of it. You receive a simple thank you before they "
"leave."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1944
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DAWN_WIN\"]/loadEventList/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1951
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DAWN_WIN_INITIATE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The New Dawn ship is still wary of you even after the fight. You watch as "
"they move up to the wreck and carefully extract a single component, you're "
"not what it is, but with that done they back away from the wreck, "
"uninterested in the rest of it. \"Captain, if you ever make it to the New "
"Dawn Forward Operating Base I'll ensure you get through unopposed, try and "
"find me once you're there.\""

#: src-en/data/events_sector_og_iron.xml:1955
msgid ""
"data/events_sector_og_iron.xml$//event[@name=\"OG_IRON_PROTOTYPE_DAWN_WIN_INITIATE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."
